            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imili 7:51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lelo nga cakuti bakayebelela no kupapata pa bubifi bwabo, na pa bubifi bwa bashibo ubo bacitile ubwa kunsangukila no kuntalamina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "icalengele na ine mbatalamine no kubatuma mu calo ca balwani babo, nga cakuti bayalula imitima yabo no kubwelulukila kuli ine no kufuta pa bubifi bwabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.7+GEN.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 17:7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.3+GEN.26.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:3-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13+GEN.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awe na ine lyena nkebukisha icipangano candi ico nacitile kuli Yakobo, Isaki na Abrahamu. Kabili ndi nokwibukisha ne calo cenu cine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icalo cena cili nokushala pakuti cikasekele Amasabata pantu cikaba amatololo. Bali nokukandwa pa mulandu wakusangukila amafunde yandi ne Yawe, pamo pene no kusuula ifipope fyandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nangu cibe ifyo fine, ilyo aba bantu bacili mu calo ca balwani babo nshakabalekeleshe iyoo, nangufye ukubonaula umupwilapo, ninshi naonaula icipangano candi ico napangene nabo. Nine Yawe Lesa wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili pa mulandu wabo wine, ndi nokwibukisha ne cipangano nacitile kuli bashibo, abo nafumishe mu calo ca Egupto pa cinso ca mishobo, pakuti mbe Lesa wabo. Nine Yawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi aya e mafunde, ifipope kabili ne fikomo ifyo Yawe abikile pakati kakwe na bena Israeli ukupitila muli Mose ku lupili lwa Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
